      "\n",
      "========== FINAL PROJECT SUMMARY ==========\n",
      "Highest Profit Per Order: In-Store\n",
      "Lowest Profit Per Order: Uber Eats\n",
      "Total Margin Outliers: 0\n",
      "\n",
